<task id="237" project="customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>customerId standard at intake (D10 / INCOMING-CUSTOMERID-STANDARD) — validate ^[a-z][a-z0-9]{2,7}$ at POST /api/runs + intake schema + /provision-environment; registry column MaxLength 8; display name recorded once; fixtures, scripts and docs aligned</title>
    <phase>Model 1 dedicated-stamp remediation — plan §7 T237 (INCOMING-CUSTOMERID-STANDARD §3.1–§3.4; owner D10)</phase>
    <gate>startable</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <completed-on>2026-09-30</completed-on>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies production .cs (RunsEndpoints + a new Core standard type), ~45 test files, the L3 skill (.claude), PowerShell scripts, and LIVE Dataverse metadata in the admin environment; root §8 test-modifying override applies.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Cross-cutting (API edge + schema + skill + scripts + fixture sweep across two test projects) with a live, hard-to-reverse Dataverse metadata change on an alternate-key column.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
